## Usage Instructions

1. Render a PDF page to PNG (300 DPI) at `pdf_pages/<paper_id>/page_<n>.png`
2. Open the candidate record file with the rendered page side by side
3. Classify each record as `true_positive`, `false_positive`, or `unresolved`
4. Record your reasoning in `annotation_notes`
5. Write the completed JSONL record to `PDF_EQUATION_REFERENCE_ANNOTATIONS_v1_2026-10-17.jsonl`

## Provenance Chain

```
DATASETS/candidates_<paper>.json (accepted baseline, 4,921 records)
  → PDF_CANDIDATE_UNIQUENESS_AUDIT_v1_2026-10-17.json (automated pre-class)
  → PDF_EQUATION_REFERENCE_ANNOTATIONS_v1_2026-10-17.jsonl (human annotation)
  → PDF_EQUATION_LEVEL_VALIDATION_REPORT_v1_2026-10-17.md (final metrics)
```
